%rec: OpeningBranch

# Daniel Harker is the new Ripperdoc, who took over after he locked Drake away.
# Drake Gallows is the original Ripperdoc locked away in the cellar of the hospital.

# When the game starts, Daniel is the Ripperdoc and Drake is locked away.

cond: !HasFlag('drake_promised_freedom')
goto: FoundInCellar

cond: HasFlag('Killed(daniel_harker)') && HasFlag('drake_promised_freedom')
goto: DrakeAfterKillingDaniel

cond: true
goto: JustLeaving

%rec: Nodes

name: JustLeaving
npc: I don't have time for this.
effect: EndWithChatter

name: EndNoPayment
npc: Thank you! For what it's worth, there is a small stash in the operating room.
+ We both had a key, here is mine.
#
effect: GiveItemToPlayer('doc_stash_key')
effect: SetFlag('drake_freed_without_payment')
effect: EndWithChatter


name: FoundInCellar
npc: Damn, get me out of here already.
#
o_text: Sure thing.
o_goto: FreeDrake
#
o_text: So, who are you?
o_goto: WhoAreYou
#
o_text: Do you know a guy named 'Jacob'?
o_cond: HasFlag('JobRead(starter)')
o_goto: DrakeJacobQuestion
#
o_text: I am your executioner.
o_goto: EndKillDrake

name: FreeDrake
npc: You are busting me out? This must be my lucky day.
#
o_text: You are welcome.
o_goto: EndNoPayment
#
o_text: Nothing is free. I need something from you.
o_goto: NothingIsFree

name: WhoAreYou
npc: I am Drake Gallows, I work here.
+ Daniel, the bastard, locked me away in the cellar.
#
o_text: Stay calm. I will get you out.
o_goto: FreeDrake
#
o_text: So you have no idea why he did this?
o_goto: WhyDidHeDoThis
#
o_text: I have no running contract involving you. I am leaving.
o_goto: NoContract
#
o_text: I just don't get why he didn't kill you. I will correct this mistake right here.
o_goto: EndKillDrake

name: WhyDidHeDoThis
npc: I sure do.
+ We are running a clinic for augmented patients.
+ As you might know from the press, these patients are depending on regular
+ medication with 'Meld'. This stuff is hard to acquire without support from the
+ big corporations. So Daniel took a shortcut and found some local gangsters that could provide the stuff.
+ When I found out I told him he has to stop making shady deals in back alleys.
+ He is putting our joint venture at risk and I won't be silent about it anymore.
+ That's when he flipped and forced me down here at gun point.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: NothingIsFree
npc: Figures. So what is it?
#
o_text: You owe me 1000 sat for my troubles.
o_goto: WantCash
#
o_text: You owe me a favor. You'll see me again.
o_goto: EndWithFavor

name: WantCash
npc: Listen, I obviously don't run this hospital anymore,
+ but I got 200 sat right here with me.
+ It's all yours if you just open that damned door.
#
o_text: Fine, we have a deal.
o_goto: EndWithPayment
#
o_text: Let's just say you owe me a favor then.
o_goto: EndWithFavor
#
o_text: I'll think about it.
o_goto: FoundInCellar


name: EndWithPayment
npc: Fine. I am leaving now.
#
effect: SetFlag('drake_promised_freedom')
effect: GiveItemToPlayer('gold', 200)
effect: EndWithChatter


name: EndWithFavor
npc: Guess I have no choice. I am leaving then.
#
effect: SetFlag('drake_promised_freedom')
effect: SetFlag('drake_owes_favor')
effect: EndWithChatter

name: EndKillDrake
npc: What? Why?
#
effect: StartCombat

name: NoContract
npc: So, you are for hire? I have a really simple job for you right now.
#
o_text: I am listening.
o_goto: WantCash
#
o_text: I am not interested.
o_goto: EndLeaveDrake

name: EndLeaveDrake
npc: (Drake sneers, his voice is cold.)
+ So, you’re just going to leave me here to rot, huh?
#
effect: EndWithChatter


### After Daniel is killed ###


name: DrakeAfterKillingDaniel
npc: What can I do for you?
#
o_text: I need some medical supplies.
o_goto: DrakeMedicalSupplies
#
o_text: I need some cyberware.
o_goto: DrakeCyberware
#
o_text: Do you know a guy named 'Jacob'?
o_cond: HasFlag('JobRead(starter)')
o_goto: DrakeJacobQuestion
#
o_text: Nothing.
o_goto: End

name: DrakeJacobQuestion
npc: No, not really.
+ Wait, I think Daniel mentioned him once.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: DrakeCyberware
npc: (Drake scratches the back of his neck, looking uneasy.)
npc: Look, I’d love to help you out, but... my tools are busted. Some scavengers hit the place while I was locked up.
+ Can’t do installs without the proper gear, you understand.
#
o_text: You’re telling me a Ripperdoc doesn’t have any tools?
o_goto: DrakeCyberwareExcuse
#
o_text: Fine, I’ll come back later.
o_goto: End

name: DrakeCyberwareExcuse
npc: Hey, this is no joke. I need time to restock and get things running again. Come back in a few days.
#
o_text: I don’t have time for excuses, Drake.
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Alright. But don’t waste my time when I return.
o_goto: End

name: DrakeMedicalSupplies
npc: (Drake gives a nervous chuckle.)
npc: About that... I, uh, just had a little “inventory issue.” Someone else cleared me out before you showed up.
+ Nothing left but dust right now.
#
o_text: How convenient.
o_goto: End
#
o_text: You’re full of it, Drake. This better not happen again.
o_goto: End
